From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:06:28 +0000
Subject: fix(render-android): harden UI scheduler task queue against races and
 teardown

Context-thread producers and the main thread shared the pending task lists
without a lock. Move queue state into a locked KuiklyRenderCoreTaskQueue,
gate every entry point on destroy(), and skip null tasks in a batch instead
of crashing. Upstream's turboDisplay isMarkViewDidLoad direct path (#1679)
is kept; the destroyed guard is added to both of its branches.

Fork-Patch: render-android-ui-scheduler-task-queue
Origin: 71227e68
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

